# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# What stays out of the repository.
#
# The project is the server, the tools, the mirrored library and the
# receipts of the last acceptance run. The things below are either
# toolchains a machine installs for itself, build output that can be
# produced again, or working files that belong to a single run.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------

# Toolchains and build output
tools/node24/
tools/mingw64/
tools/mingw-binutils/
tools/.cache/
.cargo/

# Browser profiles used for crawling and for the verification runs
tools/chrome-*/

# Scratch area of the tools. Everything the scripts write while they
# run belongs to one run and is not part of the project.
work/*
!work/README.md

# Pictures and audio drawn by the generators while a work was being
# built. They are produced again by the tools that need them.
art/

# Scratch scripts written while chasing one question; they are replaced
# by a real tool under tools/ once the question is answered.
tools/_*.mjs

# The scripts that answered one question and were never needed again.
# The archive next to the project keeps a copy of every one of them.
tools/probes/
tools/probe-*
tools/debug-*
tools/dump-*
tools/show-*
tools/inspect-*
tools/compare-*
tools/count-*
tools/test-*
tools/deobfuscate-*
tools/*-login*
tools/*-login.mjs
tools/seed-browser-login.mjs
tools/*-guest-paths.mjs
tools/*-prices.mjs
tools/sweep-trials.mjs
tools/make-entry-test.mjs

# Credentials that belong to one account, never to the repository
work/*.txt
work/*.cookie
*.token
*.cookie
.env
.env.*

# Editor and OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.tmp
*.log
*.err
__pycache__/

# Node
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
